    "attributes": {
        "action": "Require free parking for all electric vehicles",
        "additional_details": "By incentivising electric vehicles, we could boost our chances of meeting our climate goals. Free parking could make electric vehicles more financially viable for those considering the switch.\r\n\r\nElectric cars are not just for the wealthy: many modest earners are saving-up and switching to help tackle climate change. Let\u2019s reward them for doing the right thing.",
        "background": "Follow Poland\u2019s lead by making parking free for all electric vehicles in parking spaces owned or managed by local authorities.",
